pan begin="24.600" end="24.900">続</span><span begin="24.940" end="25.030">け</span><span begin="25.100" end="25.200">た</span><span begin="25.270" end="25.410">未</span><span begin="25.430" end="25.790">来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而不断描绘的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">而不斷描繪的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The future we kept drawing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">계속 그려왔던 미래</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Egakitsuzuketa mirai</span></p><p begin="25.790" end="28.800" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.790" end="25.920">偉</span><span begin="25.950" end="26.130">大</span><span begin="26.220" end="26.420">さ</span><span begin="26.460" end="26.580">に</span><span begin="26.780" end="27.040">欲</span><span begin="27.110" end="27.380">望</span><span begin="27.410" end="27.520">し</span><span begin="27.600" end="27.900">続</span><span begin="27.940" end="28.060">け</span><span begin="28.110" end="28.190">て</span><span begin="28.260" end="28.560">数</span><span begin="28.610" end="28.800">年</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">持续渴求着伟大已数年</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">持續渴求著偉大已數年</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Desiring greatness for years</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">위대함을 계속 갈망한 지 수년</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Idaisa ni yokubou shitsuzukete suunen</span></p><p begin="29.100" end="31.840" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.100" end="29.370">爪</span><span begin="29.470" end="29.680">も</span><span begin="29.760" end="30.030">髪</span><span begin="30.130" end="30.380">も</span><span begin="30.430" end="30.610">手</span><span begin="30.610" end="30.750">入</span><span begin="30.790" end="31.080">れ</span><span begin="31.110" end="31.170">不</span><span begin="31.210" end="31.560">足</span><span begin="31.610" end="31.840">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">指甲和头发都疏于打理</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">指甲和頭髮都疏於打理</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Nails and hair lacking care</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">손톱도 머리카락도 관리 부족이야</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsume mo kami mo teire busoku da</span></p><p begin="32.430" end="34.950" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.430" end="32.760">奪</span><span begin="32.760" end="32.980">う</span><span begin="33.090" end="33.400">側</span><span begin="33.450" end="33.630">と</span><span begin="33.630" end="33.940">奪</span><span begin="33.960" end="34.110">わ</span><span begin="34.120" end="34.260">れ</span><span begin="34.280" end="34.560">る</span><span begin="34.620" end="34.950">側</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掠夺的一方与被掠夺的一方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">掠奪的一方與被掠奪的一方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Those who take and those who are taken from</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빼앗는 쪽과 빼앗기는 쪽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ubau gawa to ubawareru gawa</span></p><p begin="35.120" end="37.550" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.120" end="35.430">与</span><span begin="35.430" end="35.610">え</span><span begin="35.630" end="35.780">る</span><span begin="35.780" end="36.050">側</span><span begin="36.110" end="36.250">と</span><span begin="36.250" end="36.650">与</span><span begin="36.650" end="36.760">え</span><span begin="36.780" end="36.910">ら</span><span begin="36.940" end="37.080">れ</span><span begin="37.100" end="37.230">る</span><span begin="37.250" end="37.550">側</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给予的一方与被给予的一方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">給予的一方與被給予的一方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Those who give and those who are given to</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">주는 쪽과 받는 쪽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ataeru gawa to ataerareru gawa</span></p><p begin="37.790" end="40.110" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.790" end="37.890">気</span><span begin="37.920" end="38.030">付</span><span begin="38.110" end="38.390">く</span><span begin="38.440" end="38.570">ま</span><span begin="38.610" end="38.730">で</span><span begin="38.770" end="39.060">何</span><span begin="39.080" end="39.230">度</span><span begin="39.230" end="39.740">失</span><span begin="39.740" end="39.930">っ</span><span begin="39.930" end="40.110">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到察觉为止究竟失去了多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">直到察覺為止究竟失去了多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How many times did I lose until I noticed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨달을 때까지 몇 번이나 잃었을까</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizuku made nando ushinatta</span></p><p begin="40.460" end="42.470" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.460" end="40.770">思</span><span begin="40.770" end="40.890">い</span><span begin="40.940" end="41.190">返</span><span begin="41.220" end="41.370">す</span><span begin="41.400" end="41.600">ほ</span><span begin="41.610" end="41.750">ど</span><span begin="41.780" end="41.880">無</span><span begin="41.910" end="42.260">様</span><span begin="42.260" end="42.470">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是回想越觉得狼狈不堪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">越是回想越覺得狼狽不堪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s so clumsy the more I look back</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">되돌아볼수록 꼴사나워</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omoikaesu hodo buzama da</span></p><p begin="42.770" end="45.120" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.770" end="43.240">証</span><span begin="43.240" end="43.390">を</span><span begin="43.420" end="43.760">残</span><span begin="43.760" end="43.860">し</span><span begin="43.930" end="44.190">た</span><span begin="44.270" end="44.640">か</span><span begin="44.640" end="44.760">っ</span><span begin="44.760" end="44.930">た</span><span begin="44.960" end="45.120">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要留下证明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想要留下證明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Wanting to leave a proof</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">증거를 남기고 싶거나</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Akashi o nokoshitakattari</span></p><p begin="45.430" end="47.800" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.430" end="45.680">大</span><span begin="45.740" end="46.060">切</span><span begin="46.080" end="46.220">な</span><span begin="46.280" end="46.410">も</span><span begin="46.430" end="46.540">の</span><span begin="46.610" end="46.960">が</span><span begin="46.960" end="47.320">あ</span><span begin="47.320" end="47.420">っ</span><span begin="47.420" end="47.590">た</span><span begin="47.630" end="47.800">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亦或是有着珍视的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">亦或是有著珍視的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Having something precious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소중한 것이 있거나</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Taisetsu na mono ga attari</span></p><p begin="48.230" end="50.470" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.230" end="48.400">死</span><span begin="48.440" end="48.540">に</span><span begin="48.600" end="48.720">絶</span><span begin="48.720" end="48.840">え</span><span begin="48.940" end="49.170">た</span><span begin="49.260" end="49.550">選</span><span begin="49.610" end="50.010">択</span><span begin="50.030" end="50.240">肢</span><span begin="50.280" end="50.470">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些已经死绝的选项</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些已經死絕的選項</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The dead choices</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끊어져 버린 선택지가</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shinitaeta sentakushi ga</span></p><p begin="50.770" end="53.170" itunes:ke