begin="58.480" end="58.510">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">应该守护的事物是什么？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">應該守護的事物是什麼？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What is it that I should protect?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지켜야 할 것은 무엇일까？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mamorubeki mono wa nanda?</span></p><p begin="58.780" end="1:01.110" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.780" end="59.100">何</span><span begin="59.100" end="59.200">を</span><span begin="59.240" end="59.570">信</span><span begin="59.590" end="59.900">じ</span><span begin="59.940" end="1:00.280">何</span><span begin="1:00.280" end="1:00.400">を</span><span begin="1:00.440" end="1:00.550">目</span><span begin="1:00.580" end="1:00.790">指</span><span begin="1:00.790" end="1:00.900">し</span><span begin="1:00.940" end="1:01.110">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该相信什么 该以什么为目标</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">該相信什麼 該以什麼為目標</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What should I believe and aim for</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무엇을 믿고 무엇을 목표로</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani o shinji nani o mezashite</span></p><p begin="1:01.400" end="1:03.850" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.400" end="1:02.270">命</span><span begin="1:02.290" end="1:02.480">を</span><span begin="1:02.780" end="1:02.860">か</span><span begin="1:02.930" end="1:03.100">け</span><span begin="1:03.120" end="1:03.230">れ</span><span begin="1:03.270" end="1:03.630">ば</span><span begin="1:03.630" end="1:03.820">いい</span><span begin="1:03.820" end="1:03.850">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赌上性命才好呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">賭上性命才好呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To lay my life on the line?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">목숨을 걸면 될까？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Inochi o kakereba ii?</span></p><p begin="1:04.100" end="1:06.460" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.100" end="1:04.500">愛</span><span begin="1:04.560" end="1:04.720">す</span><span begin="1:04.760" end="1:04.890">べ</span><span begin="1:04.940" end="1:05.170">き</span><span begin="1:05.280" end="1:05.400">も</span><span begin="1:05.440" end="1:05.530">の</span><span begin="1:05.600" end="1:05.790">た</span><span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.190">ち</span><span begin="1:06.280" end="1:06.460">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要和应该去爱的人们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想要和應該去愛的人們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With those I should love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑해야 할 사람들과</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aisubeki monotachi to</span></p><p begin="1:06.780" end="1:09.190" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.780" end="1:07.060">同</span><span begin="1:07.080" end="1:07.200">じ</span><span begin="1:07.240" end="1:07.520">方</span><span begin="1:07.590" end="1:07.900">向</span><span begin="1:07.900" end="1:08.050">を</span><span begin="1:08.050" end="1:08.490">歩</span><span begin="1:08.760" end="1:08.840">き</span><span begin="1:08.930" end="1:09.120">た</span><span begin="1:09.120" end="1:09.190">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走在同一个方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">走在同一個方向</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to walk in the same direction</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">같은 방향으로 걷고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onaji houkou o arukitai</span></p><p begin="1:09.590" end="1:10.500" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.590" end="1:09.720">畢</span><span begin="1:09.890" end="1:10.290">生</span><span begin="1:10.290" end="1:10.500">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕生啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">畢生啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh lifetime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">필생이여</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hissei yo</span></p><p begin="1:10.570" end="1:11.770" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.570" end="1:10.730">そ</span><span begin="1:10.770" end="1:10.860">の</span><span begin="1:10.940" end="1:11.200">た</span><span begin="1:11.270" end="1:11.370">め</span><span begin="1:11.420" end="1:11.560">に</span><span begin="1:11.600" end="1:11.770">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為此</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To do that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그러기 위해서는</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono tame ni wa</span></p><p begin="1:12.110" end="1:16.230" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.110" end="1:12.740">僕</span><span begin="1:12.770" end="1:12.950">ら</span><span begin="1:12.950" end="1:13.170">は</span><span begin="1:13.270" end="1:13.470">ど</span><span begin="1:13.470" end="1:13.590">う</span><span begin="1:13.590" end="1:13.990">生</span><span begin="1:14.080" end="1:14.240">き</span><span begin="1:14.260" end="1:14.740">れ</span><span begin="1:14.780" end="1:15.010">ば</span><span begin="1:15.010" end="1:15.310">い</span><span begin="1:15.310" end="1:16.230">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们究竟该如何生存才好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們究竟該如何生存才好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">How should we live</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리는 어떻게 살아가면 될까</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bokura wa dou ikireba ii</span></p><p begin="1:25.420" end="1:27.910" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.420" end="1:25.570">小</span><span begin="1:25.570" end="1:26.110">汚</span><span begin="1:26.110" end="1:26.190">い</span><span begin="1:26.230" end="1:26.400">日</span><span begin="1:26.450" end="1:26.620">々</span><span begin="1:26.620" end="1:26.800">を</span><span begin="1:26.800" end="1:27.310">補</span><span begin="1:27.310" end="1:27.390">う</span><span begin="1:27.450" end="1:27.540">た</span><span begin="1:27.620" end="1:27.750">め</span><span begin="1:27.800" end="1:27.910">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了弥补肮脏不堪的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為了彌補骯髒不堪的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To make up for the messy days</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지저분한 나날을 보완하기 위해</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kogitanai hibi o oginau tame ni</span></p><p begin="1:28.120" end="1:30.590" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.120" end="1:28.190">見</span><span begin="1:28.290" end="1:28.450">な</span><span begin="1:28.450" end="1:28.550">い</span><span begin="1:28.580" end="1:28.760">ふ</span><span begin="1:28.780" end="1:28.900">り</span><span begin="1:28.940" end="1:29.030">ば</span><span begin="1:29.090" end="1:29.250">か</span><span begin="1:29.270" end="1:29.360">り</span><span begin="1:29.430" end="1:29.720">続</span><span begin="1:29.770" end="1:29.860">け</span><span begin="1:29.940" end="1:30.020">た</span><span begin="1:30.100" end="1:30.180">過</span><span begin="1:30.260" end="1:30.400">去</span><span begin="1:30.440" end="1:30.590">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直装作视而不见的过去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一直裝作視而不見的過去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The past I kept pretending not to see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모르는 척만 해왔던 과거가</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Minai furi bakari tsuzuketa kako ga</span></p><p begin="1:30.790" end="1:32.810" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.790" end="1:30.870">当</span><span begin="1:30.960" end="1:31.090">た</span><span begin="1:31.110" end="1:31.210">り</span><span begin="1:31.270" end="1:31.560">前</span><span begin="1:31.600" end="1:31.740">の</span><span begin="1:31.800" end="1:32.020">よ</span><span begin="1:32.020" end="1:32.110">う</span><span begin="1:32.110" end="1:32.200">に</span><span begin="1:32.260" end="1:32.530">嘲</span><span begin="1:32.570" end="1:32.810">笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">理所当然般地嘲笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">理所當然般地嘲笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Sneers as if it&apos;s obvious</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">당연하다는 듯이 조소해</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Atarimae no you ni choushou</span></p><p begin="1:33.100" end="1:35.810" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.100" end="1:33.260">プ</span><span begin="1:33.280" end="1:33.460">ラ</span><span begin="1:33.460" end="1:33.740">イ</span><span begin="1:33.770" end="1:33.890">ド</span><span begin="1:33.940" end="1:34.040">ば</span><span begin="1:34.110" end="1:34.410">か</span><span begin="1:34.450" end="1:34.570">り</span><span begin="1:34.610" end="1:34.710">が</span><span begin="1:34.750" end="1:35.030">邪</span><span begin="1:35.090" end="1:35.260">魔</span><span begin="1:35.260" end="1:35.350">を</span><span begin="1:35.400" end="1:35.620">す</span><span begin="1:35.620" end="1:35.810">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽是自尊心在作祟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盡是自尊心在作祟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Only pride gets in the way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자존심만이 방해가 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Puraido bakari ga jama o suru</span></p><p begin="1:36.440" end="1:38.920" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.440" end="1:36.800">奪</span><span begin="1:36.800" end="1:36.890">う</span><span begin="1:37.110" end="1:37.370">者</span><span begin="1:37.450" end="1:37.590">と</span><span begin="1:37.590" end="1:37.930">奪</span><span begin="1:37.930" end="1:38.100">わ</span><span begin="1:38.120" end="1:38.270">れ</span><span begin="1:38.290" end="1:38.510">る</span><span begin="1:38.630" end="1:38.920">者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掠夺者与被掠夺者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">掠奪者與被掠奪者</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Those who take and those who are taken from</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빼앗는 자와 빼앗기는 자</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ubau mono to ubawareru mono</span></p><p begin="1:39.100" end="1:41.540" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.100" end="1:39.290">失</span><span begin="1:39.450" end="1:39.690">敗</span><span begin="1:39.760" end="1:39.870">し</span><span begin="1:39.940" end="1:40.100">た</span><span begin="1:40.120" end="1:40.200">ら</span><span begin="1:40.250" end="1:40.450">失</span><span begin="1:40.610" end="1:40.880">敗</span><span begin="1:40.900" end="1:41.010">し</span><span begin="1:41.100" end="1:41.230">た</span><span begin="1:41.270" end="1:41.400">ま</span><span begin="1:41.450" end="1:41.540">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失败了就任凭它失败</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">失敗了就任憑它失敗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you fail then you just fail</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">실패하면 실패한 채로</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shippai shitara shippai shita mama</span></p><p begin="1:41.750" end="1:44.220" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.750" end="1:41.940">す</span><span begin="1:41.940" end="1:42.030">れ</span><span begin="1:42.080" end="1:42.440">違</span><span begin="1:42.440" end="1:42.520">う</span><span begin="1:42.570" end="1:42.910">生</span><span begin="1:42.960" end="1:43.190">涯</span><span begin="1:43.230" end="1:43.420">す</span><span begin="1:43.420" end="1:43.520">ら</span><span begin="1:43.570" end="1:43.900">様</span><span begin="1:43.920" end="1:44.220">々</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连擦肩而过的生涯也形形色色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連擦肩而過的生涯也形形色色</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even the passing lives are so varied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">스쳐 지나가는 생애조차 제각각</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Surechigau shougai sura samazama</span></p><p begin="1:44.430" end="1:46.510" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.430" end="1:44.470">じ</span><span begin="1:44.470" end="1:44.610">ゃ</span><span begin="1:44.610" end="1:44.720">あ</span><span begin="1:44.770" end="1:45.100">僕</span><span begin="1:45.100" end="1:45.240">は</span><span begin="1:45.280" end="1:45.590">何</span><span begin="1:45.590" end="1:45.700">を</span><span begin="1:45.720" end="1:45.850">し</span><span begin="1:45.940" end="1:46.080">て</span><span begin="1:46.080" end="1:46.290">ん</span><span begin="1:46.290" end="1:46.480">だ</span><span begin="1:46.480" end="1:46.510">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么我到底在做些什么？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那麼我到底在做些什麼？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then what am I doing?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럼 나는 무얼 하고 있는 거지？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jaa boku wa nani o shiten da?</span></p><p begin="1:46.750" end="1:51.830" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.750" end="1:46.880">自</span><span begin="1:46.930" end="1:47.210">分</span><span begin="1:47.270" end="1:47.450">勝</span><span begin="1:47.600" end="1:47.860">手</span><span begin="1:47.930" end="1:48.050">な</span><span begin="1:48.080" end="1:48.230">自</span><span begin="1:48.270" end="1:48.930">分</span><span begin="1:48.930" end="1:49.120">を</span><span begin="1:49.430" end="1:49.610">変</span><span begin="1:49.610" end="1:49.760">え</span><span begin="1:49.780" end="1:49.860">る</span><span begin="1:49.920" end="1:50.060">た</span><span begin="1:50.110" end="1:50.230">め</span><span begin="1:50.260" end="1:50.400">に</span><span begin="1:50.620" end="1:50.810">足</span><span begin="1:50.930" end="1:51.390">掻</span><span begin="1:51.440" end="1:51.540">き</span><span begin="1:51.610" end="1:51.770">た</span><span begin="1:51.770" end="1:51.830">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要为了改变任性妄为的自己而挣扎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">想要為了改變任性妄為的自己而掙扎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I want to struggle to change my selfish self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">제멋대로인 자신을 바꾸기 위해 발버둥 치고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jibungatte na jibun o kaeru tame ni agakitai</span></p><p begin="1:52.260" end="1:57.170" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.260" end="1:52.600">限</span><span begin="1:52.620" end="1:52.750">ら</span><span begin="1:52.770" end="1:52.890">れ</span><span begin="1:52.940" end="1:53.150">た</span><span begin="1:53.250" end="1:53.860">残</span><span begin="1:53.920" end="1:54.240">機</span><span begin="1:54.290" end="1:54.480">が</span><span begin="1:54.780" end="1:54.920">揺</span><span begin="1:54.940" end="1:55.080">れ</span><span begin="1:55.100" end="1:55.210">る</span><span begin="1:55.270" end="1:55.830">心</span><span begin="1:55.930" end="1:56.220">に</span><span begin="1:56.250" end="1:56.720">触</span><span begin="1:56.760" end="1:56.940">れ</span><span begin="1:56.960" end="1:57.170">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所剩无几的残机触碰着动摇的内心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所剩無幾的殘機觸碰著動搖的內心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The limited remaining lives touch my wavering heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">얼마 남지 않은 잔기가 흔들리는 마음에 닿아</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kagirareta zanki ga yureru kokoro ni fureru</span></p><p begin="1:57.450" end="1:59.820" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.450" end="1:57.600">見</span><span begin="1:57.600" end="1:58.140">失</span><span begin="1:58.140" end="1:58.270">っ</span><span begin="1:58.270" end="1:58.570">た</span><span begin="1:58.630" end="1:58.910">も</span><span begin="1:58.930" end="1:59.060">の</span><span begin="1:59.100" end="1:59.220">ば</span><span begin="1:59.270" end="1:59.430">か</span><span begin="1:59.440" end="1:59.570">り</span><span begin="1:59.590" end="1:59.820">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽是些迷失的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盡是些迷失的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s full of things I&apos;ve lost sight of</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잃어버린 것들뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Miushinatta mono bakari da</span></p><p begin="2:00.100" end="2:02.510" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.100" end="2:00.410">守</span><span begin="2:00.430" end="2:00.520">り</span><span begin="2:00.570" end="2:00.700">そ</span><span begin="2:00.750" end="2:00.910">こ</span><span begin="2:00.960" end="2:01.110">な</span><span begin="2:01.110" end="2:01.260">っ</span><span begin="2:01.260" end="2:01.420">た</span><span begin="2:01.450" end="2:01.590">も</span><span begin="2:01.620" end="2:01.740">の</span><span begin="2:01.780" end="2:01.890">ば</span><span begin="2:01.930" end="2:02.090">か</span><span begin="2:02.110" end="2:02.250">り</span><span begin="2:02.270" end="2:02.510">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽是些没能守护好的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盡是些沒能守護好的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s full of things I failed to protect</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지켜내지 못한 것들뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mamorisokonatta mono bakari da</span></p><p begin="2:02.770" end="2:05.150" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.770" end="2:03.090">何</span><span begin="2:03.090" end="2:03.200">を</span><span begin="2:03.240" end="2:03.570">信</span><span begin="2:03.600" end="2:03.900">じ</span><span begin="2:03.940" end="2:04.280">何</span><span begin="2:04.280" end="2:04.380">を</span><span begin="2:04.440" end="2:04.550">目</span><span begin="2:04.580" end="2:04.760">指</span><span begin="2:04.760" end="2:04.880">し</span><span begin="2:04.940" end="2:05.150">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该相信什么 该以什么为目标</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">該相信什麼 該以什麼為目標</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What should I believe and aim for</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">무엇을 믿고 무엇을 목표로</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani o shinji nani o mezashite</span></p><p begin="2:05.430" end="2:07.870" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.430" end="2:06.260">命</span><span begin="2:06.290" end="2:06.490">を</span><span begin="2:06.770" end="2:07.030">諭</span><span begin="2:07.070" end="2:07.250">せ</span><span begin="2:07.300" end="2:07.630">ば</span><span begin="2:07.630" end="2:07.840">いい</span><span begin="2:07.840" end="2:07.870">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说服生命才好呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">說服生命才好呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">To persuade my life?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생명을 타이르면 될까？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Inochi o satoseba ii?</span></p><p begin="2:08.120" end="2:13.170" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.120" end="2:08.480">愛</span><span begin="2:08.540" end="2:08.720">す</span><span begin="2:08.760" end="2:08.890">べ</span><span begin="2:08.940" end="2:09.170">き</span><span begin="2:09.280" end="2:09.530">者</span><span begin="2:09.620" end="2:09.830">た</span><span begin="2:09.940" end="2:10.250">ち</span><span begin="2:10.250" end="2:10.460">を</span><span begin="2:10.760" end="2:11.000">愛</span><span begin="2:11.050" end="2:11.260">す</span><span begin="2:11.280" end="2:11.380">る</span><span begin="2:11.420" end="2:11.540">こ</span><span begin="2:11.600" end="2:11.870">と</span><span begin="2:11.900" end="2:12.060">は</span><span begin="2:12.100" end="2:12.190">で</span><span begin="2:12.250" end="2:12.740">き</span><span begin="2:12.770" end="2:12.870">る</span><span begin="2:12.940" end="2:13.140">か</span><span begin="2:13.140" end="2:13.170">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能够去爱那些应该去爱的人吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">能夠去愛那些應該去愛的人嗎？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can I love those who should be loved?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑해야 할 사람들을 사랑할 수 있을까？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aisubeki monotachi o aisuru koto wa dekiru ka?</span></p><p begin="2:13.580" end="2:14.640" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.580" end="2:13.730">畢</span><span begin="2:13.910" end="2:14.290">生</span><span begin="2:14.290" end="2:14.640">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕生啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">畢生啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh lifetime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">필생이여</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hissei yo</span></p><p begin="2:14.640" end="2:20.220" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.640" end="2:14.880">愚</span><span begin="2:14.940" end="2:15.310">か</span><span begin="2:15.380" end="2:15.560">さ</span><span begin="2:15.560" end="2:15.830">を</span><span begin="2:16.090" end="2:16.240">ど</span><span begin="2:16.240" end="2:16.710">う</span><span begin="2:16.750" end="2:16.880">に</span><span begin="2:16.950" end="2:17.180">も</span><span begin="2:17.260" end="2:17.610">拭</span><span begin="2:17.610" end="2:18.030">え</span><span begin="2:18.090" end="2:18.240">な</span><span begin="2:18.240" end="2:18.740">い</span><span begin="2:18.790" end="2:18.910">の</span><span begin="2:18.950" end="2:20.220">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份愚蠢无论如何也无法抹去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這份愚蠢無論如何也無法抹去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I just can&apos;t wipe away the foolishness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어리석음을 도무지 지울 수가 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Orokasa o dounimo nuguenai no da</span></p><p begin="2:29.460" end="2:33.930" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.460" end="2:29.930">愛</span><span begin="2:30.030" end="2:30.260">さ</span><span begin="2:30.290" end="2:30.660">れ</span><span begin="2:30.760" end="2:30.940">た</span><span begin="2:30.940" end="2:31.320">い</span><span begin="2:31.440" end="2:31.590">な</span><span begin="2:31.630" end="2:31.830">ら</span><span begin="2:32.100" end="2:32.640">愛</span><span begin="2:32.730" end="2:32.930">す</span><span begin="2:32.970" end="2:33.380">れ</span><span begin="2:33.450" end="2:33.600">ば</span><span begin="2:33.600" end="2:33.770">い</span><span begin="2:33.770" end="2:33.930">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果想要被爱的话去爱就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果想要被愛的話去愛就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you want to be loved then just love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑받고 싶다면 사랑하면 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aisaretai nara aisureba ii</span></p><p begin="2:34.720" end="2:39.240" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.720" end="2:35.120">与</span><span begin="2:35.120" end="2:35.370">え</span><span begin="2:35.460" end="2:35.600">ら</span><span begin="2:35.680" end="2:35.990">れ</span><span begin="2:36.110" end="2:36.300">た</span><span begin="2:36.300" end="2:36.680">い</span><span begin="2:36.770" end="2:36.880">な</span><span begin="2:36.970" end="2:37.160">ら</span><span begin="2:37.420" end="2:38.060">与</span><span begin="2:38.060" end="2:38.250">え</span><span begin="2:38.300" end="2:38.680">れ</span><span begin="2:38.750" end="2:38.940">ば</span><span begin="2:38.940" end="2:39.030">い</span><span begin="2:39.030" end="2:39.240">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果想要被给予的话去给予就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果想要被給予的話去給予就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you want to be given to then just give</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">받고 싶다면 주면 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ataeraretai nara ataereba ii</span></p><p begin="2:40.440" end="2:42.910" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.440" end="2:40.720">誰</span><span begin="2:40.770" end="2:40.920">か</span><span begin="2:40.960" end="2:41.130">の</span><span begin="2:41.130" end="2:41.600">命</span><span begin="2:41.600" end="2:41.720">を</span><span begin="2:41.760" end="2:41.890">蹴</span><span begin="2:41.890" end="2:42.060">落</span><span begin="2:42.110" end="2:42.190">と</span><span begin="2:42.250" end="2:42.390">し</span><span begin="2:42.450" end="2:42.550">て</span><span begin="2:42.620" end="2:42.750">ま</span><span begin="2:42.780" end="2:42.910">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至不惜将谁的生命踢落</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">甚至不惜將誰的生命踢落</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if it means kicking down someone&apos;s life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">누군가의 생명을 짓밟으면서까지</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dareka no inochi o keotoshite made</span></p><p begin="2:43.090" end="2:44.760" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.090" end="2:43.380">保</span><span begin="2:43.430" end="2:43.540">ち</span><span begin="2:43.600" end="2:43.890">続</span><span begin="2:43.930" end="2:44.040">け</span><span begin="2:44.110" end="2:44.230">た</span><span begin="2:44.240" end="2:44.360">時</span><span begin="2:44.420" end="2:44.760">間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而一直保持的时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">而一直保持的時間</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The time I kept maintaining</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지켜왔던 시간</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tamochitsuzuketa jikan</span></p><p begin="2:44.760" end="2:48.240" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.760" end="2:44.880">未</span><span begin="2:44.900" end="2:45.180">熟</span><span begin="2:45.220" end="2:45.460">さ</span><span begin="2:45.460" end="2:45.550">を</span><span begin="2:45.740" end="2:45.850">捨</span><span begin="2:45.920" end="2:46.010">て</span><span begin="2:46.080" end="2:46.300">去</span><span begin="2:46.300" end="2:46.430">っ</span><span begin="2:46.430" end="2:46.520">て</span><span begin="2:46.580" end="2:46.890">救</span><span begin="2:46.890" end="2:47.070">う</span><span begin="2:47.110" end="2:47.190">べ</span><span begin="2:47.250" end="2:47.380">き</span><span begin="2:47.440" end="2:47.550">も</span><span begin="2:47.600" end="2:47.710">の</span><span begin="2:47.760" end="2:47.970">が</span><span begin="2:47.970" end="2:48.090">あ</span><span begin="2:48.110" end="2:48.240">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">舍弃掉那份不成熟 有着应该去拯救的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">捨棄掉那份不成熟 有著應該去拯救的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Discarding immaturity there are things to save</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">미숙함을 버리고 구해야 할 것이 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mijukusa o sutesatte sukuubeki mono ga aru</span></p><p begin="2:48.440" end="2:50.860" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.440" end="2:48.760">鈍</span><span begin="2:48.760" end="2:48.880">い</span><span begin="2:48.930" end="2:49.440">心</span><span begin="2:49.440" end="2:49.600">が</span><span begin="2:49.620" end="2:49.890">今</span><span begin="2:49.930" end="2:50.050">だ</span><span begin="2:50.100" end="2:50.190">と</span><span begin="2:50.220" end="2:50.570">叫</span><span begin="2:50.600" end="2:50.860">ぶ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迟钝的内心呼喊着就是现在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">遲鈍的內心呼喊著就是現在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My dull heart screams that it&apos;s now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">둔해진 마음이 지금이라고 외쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nibui kokoro ga ima da to sakebu</span></p><p begin="2:52.090" end="2:54.440" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.090" end="2:52.290">見</span><span begin="2:52.290" end="2:52.820">失</span><span begin="2:52.820" end="2:52.960">っ</span><span begin="2:52.960" end="2:53.220">た</span><span begin="2:53.270" end="2:53.550">も</span><span begin="2:53.620" end="2:53.700">の</span><span begin="2:53.760" end="2:53.870">ば</span><span begin="2:53.910" end="2:54.060">か</span><span begin="2:54.090" end="2:54.230">り</span><span begin="2:54.260" end="2:54.440">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽是些迷失的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盡是些迷失的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s full of things I&apos;ve lost sight of</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잃어버린 것들뿐이라서</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Miushinatta mono bakari de</span></p><p begin="2:54.760" end="2:57.160" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.760" end="2:55.070">守</span><span begin="2:55.090" end="2:55.230">れ</span><span begin="2:55.280" end="2:55.520">な</span><span begin="2:55.580" end="2:55.750">か</span><span begin="2:55.750" end="2:55.930">っ</span><span begin="2:55.930" end="2:56.070">た</span><span begin="2:56.120" end="2:56.220">も</span><span begin="2:56.280" end="2:56.380">の</span><span begin="2:56.430" end="2:56.540">ば</span><span begin="2:56.590" end="2:56.750">か</span><span begin="2:56.790" end="2:56.930">り</span><span begin="2:56.930" end="2:57.160">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽是些没能守护好的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盡是些沒能守護好的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s full of things I couldn&apos;t protect</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지키지 못한 것들뿐이라서</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mamorenakatta mono bakari de</span></p><p begin="2:57.430" end="2:59.800" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.430" end="2:57.540">し</span><span begin="2:57.590" end="2:57.760">か</span><span begin="2:57.760" end="2:57.860">し</span><span begin="2:57.940" end="2:58.210">確</span><span begin="2:58.270" end="2:58.420">か</span><span begin="2:58.450" end="2:58.560">に</span><span begin="2:58.630" end="2:58.960">胸</span><span begin="2:58.960" end="2:59.200">を</span><span begin="2:59.250" end="2:59.410">張</span><span begin="2:59.410" end="2:59.610">っ</span><span begin="2:59.610" end="2:59.800">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是确实能挺起胸膛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但是確實能挺起胸膛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But surely sticking my chest out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하지만 확실하게 가슴을 펴고</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shikashi tashika ni mune o hatte</span></p><p begin="3:00.100" end="3:02.440" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.100" end="3:00.220">な</span><span begin="3:00.280" end="3:00.680">り</span><span begin="3:00.770" end="3:00.960">た</span><span begin="3:00.960" end="3:01.180">い</span><span begin="3:01.450" end="3:01.570">未</span><span begin="3:01.590" end="3:01.900">来</span><span begin="3:01.930" end="3:02.100">が</span><span begin="3:02.100" end="3:02.280">あ</span><span begin="3:02.280" end="3:02.440">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有着想要成为的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">有著想要成為的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There is a future I want to become</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">되고 싶은 미래가 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Naritai mirai ga aru</span></p><p begin="3:02.760" end="3:07.800" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.760" end="3:03.170">愛</span><span begin="3:03.250" end="3:03.400">す</span><span begin="3:03.430" end="3:03.550">べ</span><span begin="3:03.620" end="3:03.860">き</span><span begin="3:03.910" end="3:04.220">者</span><span begin="3:04.280" end="3:04.500">た</span><span begin="3:04.630" end="3:04.920">ち</span><span begin="3:04.940" end="3:05.110">を</span><span begin="3:05.420" end="3:05.850">愛</span><span begin="3:05.900" end="3:06.050">す</span><span begin="3:06.090" end="3:06.220">べ</span><span begin="3:06.260" end="3:06.510">き</span><span begin="3:06.590" end="3:06.670">と</span><span begin="3:06.740" end="3:06.870">気</span><span begin="3:06.920" end="3:07.150">づ</span><span begin="3:07.420" end="3:07.560">い</span><span begin="3:07.610" end="3:07.800">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉到了应该去爱那些应该去爱的人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">察覺到了應該去愛那些應該去愛的人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I realized I should love those who should be loved</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사랑해야 할 사람들을 사랑해야 한다는 걸 깨달았어</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aisubeki monotachi o aisubeki to kizuita</span></p><p begin="3:08.240" end="3:09.300" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.240" end="3:08.360">畢</span><span begin="3:08.550" end="3:08.930">生</span><span begin="3:08.930" end="3:09.300">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕生啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">畢生啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh lifetime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">필생이여</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hissei yo</span></p><p begin="3:09.300" end="3:18.870" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.300" end="3:09.440">終</span><span begin="3:09.440" end="3:09.620">わ</span><span begin="3:09.660" end="3:09.900">る</span><span begin="3:09.940" end="3:10.060">の</span><span begin="3:10.100" end="3:10.250">な</span><span begin="3:10.270" end="3:10.460">ら</span><span begin="3:10.780" end="3:10.850">あ</span><span begin="3:10.950" end="3:11.380">な</span><span begin="3:11.450" end="3:11.590">た</span><span begin="3:11.630" end="3:11.810">の</span><span begin="3:12.090" end="3:12.220">希</span><span begin="3:12.270" end="3:12.890">望</span><span begin="3:12.940" end="3:13.400">と</span><span begin="3:13.440" end="3:13.620">な</span><span begin="3:13.640" end="3:18.870">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果终将迎来终结 便化作你的希望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果終將迎來終結 便化作你的希望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If it ends I will become your hope</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝난다면 너의 희망이 될게</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Owaru no nara anata no kibou to naru</span></p></div></body></tt>